#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:200
msgid "API Server"
msgstr "APIサーバー"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:216
msgid ""
"Keep the default address filled in here to get administrative address "
"changes (province/ward renames, boundary updates) as soon as they're "
"published, without needing to update the plugin itself. Checkout still works "
"even if this is left blank or the server is temporarily unreachable - the "
"plugin automatically falls back to the data bundled with the plugin."
msgstr "最新のベトナム行政住所の変更を受け取るため、プラグインのデフォルトAPIサーバーのままにしておくことをお勧めします。"

#. translators: %s: link to the VietMap open data source
#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:222
#, php-format
msgid "Administrative data provided by VietMap: %s."
msgstr "行政データはVietMapより提供されています: %s。"

#. translators: %s: link to the self-hostable API server source code on GitHub
#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:231
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Prefer to run your own copy instead of relying on ours? The server is open "
"source: %s."
msgstr "APIサービスのオープンソースコード: %s。"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:241
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "設定を保存"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:245
msgid "Old-to-new address conversion tool"
msgstr "旧住所から新住所への変換ツール"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:247
msgid ""
"Converts existing orders from the old address structure to the new structure "
"by matching each order against the bundled old-to-new conversion table (from "
"VietMap's published administrative mapping data, not a live API call - this "
"runs entirely on your server, with no network requests, even if an API "
"Server is configured above). Most wards convert automatically; a small "
"number that were split between multiple new wards during the merger are "
"flagged for manual review instead of being guessed. Nothing is overwritten: "
"the original address on every order stays exactly as submitted, and the "
"converted result is saved alongside it."
msgstr ""
"既存の注文を旧住所構造から新住所構造へ変換します。各注文を同梱の旧→新変換テー"
"ブル(VietMapが公開した行政マッピングデータに基づくもので、ライブAPI呼び出しで"
"はありません - 上でAPIサーバーを設定していても、この処理はすべてお使いのサー"
"バー上でネットワークリクエストなしに実行されます)と照合します。ほとんどの村/"
"区は自動的に変換されます。合併時に複数の新しい村/区に分割された一部のケース"
"は、推測せずに手動確認の対象としてフラグが立てられます。何も上書きされませ"
"ん: 各注文の元の住所は送信時のまま保持され、変換結果は別に保存されます。"

